{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日、6期生加入1周年です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobMkKPEn.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この写真は春組と夏組が初めて会った日"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなといる時話す時、まるで小さい時から一緒にいたような懐かしさを感じます。\nやっと会えたって感覚"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなと見ている景色が夢みたいで、夢ならずっと覚めないでほしいし\nみんなと一緒にいたらもっといい夢を見ることができそうな気がします。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "温かくて暖かくて、どこまでも一緒にいたいと思います。\n優しくて笑顔が溢れるみんなと同期としていることができて本当に幸せです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつもありがとう！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大好き！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これからもよろしくね！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでいただきありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "海邉朱莉"}], "source": "official"}